         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Percentiles of Priceto Book Ratios for All U.S.Traded Firms&#xA;with Market Capitalization Greater Than $200 Million, 1963â€“2010.&#xA;P/B ratios were relatively low in the 1970s and high in the 1960s and 1990s. The median is typically above 1.0.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
      </rdf:Description>
